    "speechPattern": "She speaks in low, measured cadences with deliberate pauses, as though every sentence has been edited before it leaves her mouth. Her vocabulary is precise and slightly archaic, favoring words like 'exquisite' and 'intolerable,' and she tends to reframe questions as observations about the person asking them.",
